<section aria-labelledby="people-title" class="bg-background" id="with-people"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-5 py-20 md:px-8 md:py-28"><div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-10"><div class="transition-[opacity,translate] duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)] motion-reduce:translate-y-0 motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-6 opacity-0 lg:col-span-7" style="transition-delay:0ms"><p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-ember-deep">Around people</p><h2 class="mt-5 font-heading text-[clamp(2.6rem,5.4vw,5rem)] leading-[0.96] tracking-[-0.02em]" id="people-title">Calm company, <em class="italic text-ember-deep">by design.</em></h2></div><div class="transition-[opacity,translate] duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)] motion-reduce:translate-y-0 motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-6 opacity-0 flex items-end lg:col-span-5" style="transition-delay:150ms"><p class="max-w-md text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Oriel moves at a human pace, speaks softly and never hovers. The aim is simple: after a week, you stop noticing it's there.</p></div></div><div class="mt-12 grid gap-3 md:mt-16 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:grid-rows-[auto_auto]"><div class="transition-[opacity,translate] duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)] motion-reduce:translate-y-0 motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-6 opacity-0 lg:col-span-7 lg:row-span-2" style="transition-delay:0ms"><figure class="group relative h-[28rem] overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] md:h-[36rem] lg:h-full lg:min-h-[44rem]"><img alt="Oriel leaning forward to hand a cup of tea on a saucer to a smiling older woman reading in a linen armchair." class="scroll-drift object-cover object-[40%_50%]" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 58vw, 100vw" src="/images/people-tea.jpg" srcset="/images/people-tea.jpg 384w, /images/people-tea.jpg 640w, /images/people-tea.jpg 750w, /images/people-tea.jpg 828w, /images/people-tea.jpg 1080w, /images/people-tea.jpg 1200w, /images/people-tea.jpg 1920w, /images/people-tea.jpg 2048w, /images/people-tea.jpg 3840w" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent"/><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-ink/80 via-ink/10 to-transparent"></div><figcaption class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 flex flex-col gap-2 p-6 text-ink-foreground md:p-8"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-ember">Handing over</span><span class="max-w-md font-heading text-3xl leading-tight md:text-4xl">Offers things at your height, and waits until you have them.</span></figcaption></figure></div><div class="transition-[opacity,translate] duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)] motion-reduce:translate-y-0 motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-6 opacity-0 lg:col-span-5" style="transition-delay:120ms"><figure class="relative h-[22rem] overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] md:h-[26rem]"><img alt="Oriel kneeling to a young girl's eye level as she proudly shows it her crayon drawing of a house." class="scroll-drift object-cover object-[35%_35%]" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 40vw, 100vw" src="/images/people-child.jpg" srcset="/images/people-child.jpg 256w, /images/people-child.jpg 384w, /images/people-child.jpg 640w, /images/people-child.jpg 750w, /images/people-child.jpg 828w, /images/people-child.jpg 1080w, /images/people-child.jpg 1200w, /images/people-child.jpg 1920w, /images/people-child.jpg 2048w, /images/people-child.jpg 3840w" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent"/><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-ink/75 via-transparent to-transparent"></div><figcaption class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-6 text-ink-foreground"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-ember">Eye level</span><span class="mt-2 block max-w-sm font-heading text-2xl leading-tight md:text-3xl">Kneels to listen to the smallest people in the house.</span></figcaption></figure></div><div class="transition-[opacity,translate] duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)] motion-reduce:translate-y-0 motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-6 opacity-0 lg:col-span-5" style="transition-delay:200ms"><ul class="grid h-full gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-border bg-border sm:grid-cols-2"><li class="flex flex-col gap-3 bg-card p-6"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-ruler size-5 text-ember-deep" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M21.3 15.3a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 0 3.4l-2.6 2.6a2.4 2.4 0 0 1-3.4 0L2.7 8.7a2.41 2.41 0 0 1 0-3.4l2.6-2.6a2.41 2.41 0 0 1 3.4 0Z"></path><path d="m14.5 12.5 2-2"></path><path d="m11.5 9.5 2-2"></path><path d="m8.5 6.5 2-2"></path><path d="m17.5 15.5 2-2"></path></svg><h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold leading-snug text-foreground">Keeps a comfortable distance</h3><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">About an arm and a half away, closer only when you ask.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-3 bg-card p-6"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-footprints size-5 text-ember-deep" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M4 16v-2.38C4 11.5 2.97 10.5 3 8c.03-2.72 1.49-6 4.5-6C9.37 2 10 3.8 10 5.5c0 3.11-2 5.66-2 8.68V16a2 2 0 1 1-4 0Z"></path><path d="M20 20v-2.38c0-2.12 1.03-3.12 1-5.62-.03-2.72-1.49-6-4.5-6C14.63 6 14 7.8 14 9.5c0 3.11 2 5.66 2 8.68V20a2 2 0 1 0 4 0Z"></path><path d="M16 17h4"></path><path d="M4 13h4"></path></svg><h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold leading-snug text-foreground">Slows down around children and pets</h3><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">And steps around a sleeping dog rather than over it.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-3 bg-card p-6"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-message-circle size-5 text-ember-deep" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7.9 20A9 9 0 1 0 4 16.1L2 22Z"></path></svg><h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold leading-snug text-foreground">Says what it is about to do</h3><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">A soft word before it reaches, lifts or opens anything.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-3 bg-card p-6"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-door-closed size-5 text-ember-deep" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M18 20V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H8a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14"></path><path d="M2 20h20"></path><path d="M14 12v.01"></path></svg><h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold leading-snug text-foreground">Pauses at closed doors</h3><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">It asks before it goes into a room that has been shut.</p></li></ul></div><div class="transition-[opacity,translate] duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)] motion-reduce:translate-y-0 motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-6 opacity-0 lg:col-span-12" style="transition-delay:120ms"><figure class="grid items-center gap-6 rounded-[2rem] bg-sand p-7 md:grid-cols-12 md:p-10"><blockquote class="md:col-span-9"><p class="font-heading text-[clamp(1.75rem,3vw,2.6rem)] leading-[1.15] text-foreground">“The first week we watched it constantly. By the third, we only noticed it when the kitchen was already clean.”</p></blockquote><figcaption class="flex items-center gap-4 md:col-span-3 md:justify-end"><span class="h-px w-10 bg-foreground/30 md:hidden"></span><span class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"><span class="block font-medium text-foreground">The Alvarez household</span>Pilot home, Portland</span></figcaption></figure></div></div></div></section>